>>
    @TestFactory (@TestFactory ka use dynamic tests generate karne ke liye hota hai.)


@TestFactory
Collection<DynamicTest> additionTests() {

    return List.of(
        DynamicTest.dynamicTest("2 + 3", () ->
            assertEquals(5, add(2, 3))
        ),
        DynamicTest.dynamicTest("5 + 5", () ->
            assertEquals(10, add(5, 5))
        )
    );
}
Yahan @TestFactory khud test nahi hai. Ye runtime par multiple dynamic tests create karta hai.

